' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006-web-ui - configured single-team bootstrap operator surface without auth

actor "Operator" as Operator
participant "Web UI\nno team selector\nno operator selector" as UI
participant "API Gateway\nno-auth configured bootstrap operator + team" as GW
participant "State Registry\nresource authority" as State

note over GW
Configuration: one bootstrap operator_id\n+ one team_id + canonical team_name
operator_id: audit attribution only (not auth proof)
team_id scopes; team_name displays only
end note
Operator -> UI : use dashboard labeled with team_name
UI -> GW : REST / WebSocket only\n(no internal identity headers,\nno Operator-ID, no Team-ID, no Team-Name, no Request-ID)
GW -> GW : strip client identity context\nvalidate configured bootstrap operator + team\ngenerate request_id
alt configured bootstrap operator or team invalid
  GW --> UI : reject before proxying
else valid configured bootstrap operator and team
  GW -> State : child request with configured Operator-ID,\nconfigured Team-ID, display-only Team-Name, Request-ID
  State -> State : authorize resource ownership by team_id;\nattribute to operator_id + request_id
  State --> GW : response
  GW --> UI : response unchanged
end
UI -x State : direct call forbidden
UI -x State : no alternate team origin

@enduml
